@startuml ATTEMPTS
' Fee bumping: a stuck attempt is replaced by one that pays more. The
' constrain says what a replacement is; the assume note says what no guard
' can - that the replacements stop - and csdflivelockfree takes it as a
' hypothesis of the livelock-freedom theorem once the attempts are hidden.
state "稼働中" as running {
  running : attempts ; 試行ID ⇸ Attempt

  state "attempts : 試行ID ⇸ Attempt" as runningAttempts <<promote>> {
    !include local/ATTEMPT.puml
  }
}

[*] --> running : attempts は空
' The scenario may rest once every attempt is confirmed.
running --> [*] : attempts のすべてが〈確定〉

note bottom of runningAttempts
  constrain RESEND(試行ID, 置換Tx) ; 置換Tx の置換元 は〈滞留〉にあり、置換Tx の手数料 > 置換元 の手数料
end note

note as fair
  assume 手数料を上げた置換を続ければ、いつかいずれかの試行が〈確定〉になる
end note
@enduml
